(b) of membership in a community or society (BL, §40, 2), Hch.12:1, etc.;
(with) of material (= clás. gen.; Bl. l.with; M, Pr., 102), Mt.3:4 27:21;
(d) after verbs of asking, seeking, etc., Lc.11:50, 51 1Ts.2:6 (Milligan, in l.);
(2) of the cause, instrument, means or occasion (frec. = ὑπό, παρά, and after verbs of learning, hearing, knowing, etc.; Bl., §40, 3), Mt.7:16 11:29, Lc.22:45, Hch.2:22 4:36 9:13 12:14, 1Co.11:23, Gá.3:2, etc.; ἀπὸ τ. ὄχλου, Lc.19:3 (cf. Jn.21:6, Hch.22:11); ἀπὸ τ. φόβου, Mt.14:26, etc. (cf. Mt.10:26 13:44).
